            "review_text": "Chi V\n10 contributions\n1\nCozy & unique Cocktail Bar. The best tapas in Hanoi\nJan 2023 • Friends\nThe best tapas and also cocktail in town. \nThe concept of this bar is very unique & inspired by Vietnamese traditional. It is a popular spot for locals and tourists alike, known for its stylish decor, cozy atmosphere, and a wide selection of cocktails and tapas dishes. The bar has a creative menu with a fusion of flavors blending traditional Vietnamese and Western cuisines. It's an excellent place to unwind with friends or enjoy a romantic evening with your loved one.\nRead more\nWritten March 25, 2023",
